      "text": "kafka · Kafka 4.3 (KRaft, single node)\nkafka:9092 inside the network\n\nfrom gateway:\nuser.confirmation-requested\nuser.followed · user.unfollowed\n\nfrom tweet-service:\ntweet.created · tweet.deleted\nconsumer failures go to *-dlt topics",
