      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1286223707,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Entry: browser → nginx :5173 → /api/ → gateway ×2. nginx forwards /api/ only, so /internal and /actuator are not served on :5173.\n• gateway :8080 is also published (loopback) for direct API calls; /internal/v1/** answers 404 without X-Internal-Secret.\n• tweet-, timeline- and mail-service publish no port: tweet and timeline trust X-User-Id from whoever reaches them.\n• Mail goes to Mailpit; read confirmation and follow emails at http://localhost:8025.\n\nIDE mode instead of the full stack:  docker compose -f docker-compose.infra.yml up -d\n• run each service with ./mvnw spring-boot:run on the host (:8080 gateway, :8081 tweet, :8082 mail, :8083 timeline)\n• npm run dev serves the SPA on :5173 and proxies /api → localhost:8080; the apps reach Kafka on localhost:9094.",
      "originalText": "• Entry: browser → nginx :5173 → /api/ → gateway ×2. nginx forwards /api/ only, so /internal and /actuator are not served on :5173.\n• gateway :8080 is also published (loopback) for direct API calls; /internal/v1/** answers 404 without X-Internal-Secret.\n• tweet-, timeline- and mail-service publish no port: tweet and timeline trust X-User-Id from whoever reaches them.\n• Mail goes to Mailpit; read confirmation and follow emails at http://localhost:8025.\n\nIDE mode instead of the full stack:  docker compose -f docker-compose.infra.yml up -d\n• run each service with ./mvnw spring-boot:run on the host (:8080 gateway, :8081 tweet, :8082 mail, :8083 timeline)\n• npm run dev serves the SPA on :5173 and proxies /api → localhost:8080; the apps reach Kafka on localhost:9094.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
